{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"late-payment-interest-calculator UI copy.faq.0.a","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"late-payment-interest-calculator.copy.faq.0.a","keys":["late-payment-interest-calculator.copy.faq.0.a"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Untuk hutang dengan tarikh tamat yang ditetapkan terlebih dahulu di Norway, Akta Bayaran Bayaran Terlewat berkata kadar faedah berjalan dari tarikh tamat. Jika tiada tarikh tamat ditetapkan terlebih dahulu, peraturan umum adalah ZXQPH0000QXZ hari selepas pemberi pinjaman menghantar permintaan pembayaran bertulis. Semak sebarang peraturan khas atau perjanjian sebelum memilih hari faedah pertama.","record_id":"6947f397a7ffe7c728d13ca8c316643542700f74b50a0c1998764294ea7babed","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.1170240133749303,"source":"For a debt with a due date fixed in advance in Norway, the Late Payment Interest Act says interest runs from the due date. If no due date was fixed in advance, the general rule is 30 days after the creditor sent a written payment demand. Check any special rule or agreement before selecting the first interest day.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"67f17f980f2541068e330dfaae76e687517781168dc1d9541d038d51cec6e1d3","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Untuk hutang dengan tarikh tamat yang ditetapkan terlebih dahulu di Norway, Akta Bayaran Bayaran Terlewat berkata kadar faedah berjalan dari tarikh tamat. Jika tiada tarikh tamat ditetapkan terlebih dahulu, peraturan umum adalah 30 hari selepas pemberi pinjaman menghantar permintaan pembayaran bertulis. Semak sebarang peraturan khas atau perjanjian sebelum memilih hari faedah pertama.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
